# 3. TARGET USERS

Primary users:
- University and college students
- Undergraduate students managing multiple subjects
- Students following semester-based curricula
- Students preparing for internal and semester examinations
- Students with regular homework, assignments, and laboratory work
- Students participating in group projects, presentations, and hackathons

The initial product should be particularly useful to students managing a busy weekly class timetable and a syllabus containing multiple units, chapters, and topics.

Design the data model so the application can support different institutions and academic systems without requiring institution-specific code for every feature.

