Requirements:
- Validate file types and sizes.
- Avoid trusting file extensions alone.
- Process uploads through an appropriate secure server-side workflow.
- Prevent unauthorised access to uploaded files.
- Avoid logging document contents unnecessarily.
- Avoid retaining original hall tickets by default.
