- Allow users to remove uploaded documents and associated temporary data.
- Store extracted structured information separately from temporary source files.
- Clearly explain when a document is sent to a third-party AI provider.
- Obtain appropriate consent before using an external AI service.
- Never expose private academic records to other users.

Where practical, delete temporary document data after successful extraction and confirmation.

Do not retain hall ticket photographs, signatures, or unrelated personal identifiers.

The app must not use uploaded academic documents for unrelated purposes.

