## Important rules

- Do not create duplicate classes when the same PDF is imported repeatedly.
- Do not duplicate assignments when an action is retried.
- Do not silently delete existing events.
- Do not mark topics complete automatically.
- Do not lose completed topic records when editing a chapter.
- Do not reset progress when changing a subject's display name.
- Do not move locked events during scheduling.
- Do not create duplicate notifications.
- Do not save unreviewed AI changes as confirmed records.
- Do not silently change time zones.
- Do not allow malformed recurrence rules to generate unlimited events.
- Do not permanently delete important data without clear confirmation.

Use transactions for operations that update multiple related records.

Provide undo or restoration where practical.

Create sensible conflict-resolution rules for records edited on multiple devices.

